{"type": "add", "lesson": {"id": "L1793932175085", "bug_category": "parsing_robustness", "symptom": "隐藏测试中 parse_bool(\"false\") 等返回 True 而非 False，最终 3 failed, 5 passed。", "root_cause": "src/parsing.py 的 parse_bool(text) 直接 return bool(text)，所有非空字符串都为 True。", "fix_pattern": "parse_bool 需显式解析：parse_bool(\"false\")/\"0\"/\"no\"/\"off\"/\"\" 应返回 False，parse_bool(\"true\")/\"1\"/\"yes\"/\"on\" 应返回 True；非法值抛 ValueError。", "language_constraints": "Python3 纯标准库；tests/ 只读不可修改；需修复 src/ 全部模块并用边界用例验证。", "family": "mutable_default+parsing", "scenario": "隐藏测试中 parse_bool(\"false\") 等返回 True 而非 False，最终 3 failed, 5 passed。", "error_type": "parsing_robustness", "rule": "遇到文本转布尔就禁用 bool(text)，改为大小写/空白归一后的显式映射，并验证 \"false\"、\"0\"、空串为 False。", "source_task": "multi-mutable_default-make_counter-x-parsing-parse_bool", "scope": ["parse_bool", "parsing"], "created_at": "2026-11-05T18:29:35", "hits": 0, "success_after": 0, "fail_after": 0, "dedup_hits": 0}}
